msgid "Creating your first application"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this guide, you'll create a REST endpoint, see live coding in action, add "
"a service with dependency injection, and write tests.\n"
"You won't write any boilerplate, and you won't have to restart the app, not "
"even once."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr ""

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr ""

msgid "JDK 17+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr ""

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr ""

msgid "Verify Maven is using the Java you expect"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you have multiple JDK's installed, it is not certain Maven will pick up "
"the expected java\n"
"and you could end up with unexpected results.\n"
"You can verify which JDK Maven uses by running `mvn --version`."
msgstr ""

